    "body": "I’m unsure if maybe this was intended as satirical, but if not: HTML is neither platform-specific nor architecture-specific. It’s also a [living standard](https://whatwg.org/faq#living-standard), so there is no “HTML 5.4” (etc). The W3C published snapshots of the living standard with numbers like that (not sure if they still do), but they mean nothing for the WHATWG standard or for web browsers.",
